g the service in a mixed state. I retried, and the second attempt rolled out to all three regions successfully.\n- **Verification:** All regions now on v2.3.0, `healthy: true`, error rate down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** Opened **INC-0001 (SEV2)** for checkout-api. The create call timed out, but I confirmed via `list_incidents` that it had been created, so I did not retry (avoiding a duplicate page). The summary documents the failure, the partial-rollback hiccup, the final state, and two follow-ups: root-causing v2.3.1 before any redeploy, and investigating the orchestrator error.\n\nNo approval-gated actions were needed, since v2.3.0 had previously been healthy in production.", "type": "text"}]}]}